      "id": "3e493409-5c1b-43de-97ba-dce6b91a452c",
      "sender": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::ClaudeAcpPersona",
      "time": 1787210411.4626484,
      "body": "Notebook chapitre 8 Manning \u2014 **strat\u00e9gies d'indexation avanc\u00e9es pour RAG** sur donn\u00e9es Wikivoyage (Cornwall + destinations UK).\n\nSections:\n- **8.4 Embedding strategy** \u2014 compare chunking granulaire (`HTMLSectionSplitter`) vs coarse (`RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter` 3000 chars) dans Chroma.\n- **8.4.2 MultiVectorRetriever + child chunks** \u2014 embed petits chunks enfants, retourne parent doc via `InMemoryByteStore`.\n- **8.4.3 Document summaries** \u2014 LLM (`gpt-5-nano`) r\u00e9sume chaque coarse chunk, embed le r\u00e9sum\u00e9, retourne doc original.\n- **8.4.4 Hypothetical questions** \u2014 LLM g\u00e9n\u00e8re 4 questions par chunk (structured output Pydantic), embed les questions.\n- **8.5 Granular chunk expansion** \u2014 expansion contexte autour chunks retrouv\u00e9s.\n- **8.6 Semi-structured content** \u2014 HTML/tables.\n\nPattern commun: ingest Wikivoyage \u2192 split \u2192 embed variante \u2192 Chroma + MultiVectorRetriever. Plupart des ingestions comment\u00e9es (d\u00e9j\u00e0 ex\u00e9cut\u00e9es).",
