    {
      "body": "Notebook chapitre 8 Manning \u2014 **strat\u00e9gies d'indexation avanc\u00e9es RAG** sur Wikivoyage (Cornwall + destinations UK), stockage Chroma.\n\n- **8.4 Embedding strategy** \u2014 chunks granulaires (`HTMLSectionSplitter`) vs coarse (`RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter`, 3000 chars).\n- **8.4.2 Child chunks** \u2014 `MultiVectorRetriever`: embed enfants, retourne parent via `InMemoryByteStore`.\n- **8.4.3 Summaries** \u2014 LLM (`gpt-5-nano`) r\u00e9sume coarse chunks, embed r\u00e9sum\u00e9, retourne doc original.\n- **8.4.4 Hypothetical questions** \u2014 LLM g\u00e9n\u00e8re 4 questions/chunk (Pydantic structured output), embed questions.\n- **8.5 Granular chunk expansion** \u2014 \u00e9largit contexte autour chunks retrouv\u00e9s.\n- **8.6 Semi-structured content** \u2014 HTML/tables.\n\nPlupart des ingestions comment\u00e9es (d\u00e9j\u00e0 ex\u00e9cut\u00e9es).",
